ion-62dea677-f3f9-594c-972b-a951f4087b85" :question/id #uuid "62dea677-f3f9-594c-972b-a951f4087b85" :question/math-academy-id "q-175371" :question/problem "The constant term in the expression $3m-\\frac{5n}{6}+\\frac{1}{2}$ is{{field-1}}." :question/worked-solution "The expression has three terms: \n\n$$\n3m\\,,\\,-\\frac{5n}{6}\\,,\\,\\frac{1}{2}\n$$\n\n  \n\nThe only term that does not contain any variables is $\\frac{1}{2}$, so $\\frac{1}{2}$ is the constant term." :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-eea8745d-97a9-5a2f-81ce-95241fd1a66e"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-eea8745d-97a9-5a2f-81ce-95241fd1a66e" :answer-field/id #uuid "eea8745d-97a9-5a2f-81ce-95241fd1a66e" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "answer-266981a5-842b-5298-a875-98d52befd3ad" :answer-field/choices ["answer-266981a5-842b-5298-a875-98d52befd3ad"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-266981a5-842b-5298-a875-98d52befd3ad" :answer/id #uuid "266981a5-842b-5298-a875-98d52befd3ad" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{1}{2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "question-2410df8a-af5f-5395-a8f7-6f01fb9b5a62" :question/id #uuid "2410df8a-af5f-5395-a8f7-6f01fb9b5a62" :question/math-academy-id "q-44049" :question/problem "What is the constant term in the expression $7p+\\frac{1}{5}-3q+r?$" :question/worked-solution "The expression has four terms: $7p$, $\\frac{1}{5}$, $-3q$ and $r.$ The only term that does not contain any variables is $\\frac{1}{5}$, so $\\frac{1}{5}$ is the constant term." :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-8e60f42f-6574-59d1-a9da-3e1b7e14b440"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-8e60f42f-6574-59d1-a9da-3e1b7e14b440" :answer-field/id #uuid "8e60f42f-6574-59d1-a9da-3e1b7e14b440" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radi